<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>66.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <decisions>
        <name>Is_Corporate_or_Child</name>
        <label>Is Corporate or Child</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Stamp_Practice_ID</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default Outcome</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Corporate</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.ParentId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Update_Corporate_Account</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Corporate</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Stamp value of Accounter autonumber field as corporate ID or practice ID.
2026-08-31: AP - Append &quot; - Corp&quot; to Account Name in the same $Record update that stamps the Corporate ID, so the naming convention is applied at the moment an account becomes a Dental Group rather than by periodic cleanup. Corporate branch only - the Practice branch is untouched. The corporateName formula is idempotent (skips names already ending &quot; - Corp&quot;), trims whitespace first, and skips rather than overflowing the 255-character Name limit (OPS-232).
2026-09-14: AP - The 2026-08-31 &quot;- Corp&quot; rename logic (v3) had been deployed but left in Draft and never actually executing. Redeployed the same v3 content as Active - no logic change, activation fix only.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>accounterId</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>VALUE({!$Record.Accounter__c})</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>addOnePractice</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.Practice_ID__c}+1</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>corporateName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
  OR(
    RIGHT(TRIM({!$Record.Name}), 7) = &quot; - Corp&quot;,
    LEN(TRIM({!$Record.Name})) + 7 &gt; 255
  ),
  TRIM({!$Record.Name}),
  TRIM({!$Record.Name}) &amp; &quot; - Corp&quot;
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>practiceId</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>VALUE(TEXT({!$Record.Corporate_Parent_Account__r.Corporate_ID__c})&amp;&#39;001&#39;)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Account - Before - Set Initial Corporate &amp; Practice IDs {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Account - Before - Set Initial Corporate &amp; Practice IDs</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>Stamp_Practice_ID</name>
        <label>Stamp Practice ID</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Practice_ID__c</field>
            <operator>IsNull</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Generate_Account_Numbers__c</field>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Practice_ID__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>accounterId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputReference>$Record</inputReference>
    </recordUpdates>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>Update_Corporate_Account</name>
        <label>Update Corporate Account</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Corporate_ID__c</field>
            <operator>IsNull</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Corporate_ID__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>accounterId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Generate_Account_Numbers__c</field>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Name</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>corporateName</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputReference>$Record</inputReference>
    </recordUpdates>
    <start>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Is_Corporate_or_Child</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Corporate_ID__c</field>
            <operator>IsNull</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Practice_ID__c</field>
            <operator>IsNull</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Generate_Account_Numbers__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <object>Account</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordBeforeSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
</Flow>
